      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lab 2b · An agent\n\nThe twin of the notebook's agent. **The model** decides the steps: the AI Agent loops model → tool → model until it answers.\n\n1. Click **Chat** and ask: *What tools do you have access to?* It reads them from the MCP server.\n2. Paste the Lab 1 question (in `n8n/questions.md`). Open the AI Agent's **Logs** to see each tool call.\n3. Follow up: *Does the choice of N2 model change the selectivity? Compare the top three.* The chain (2a) can't do this without new nodes.\n\n**Simple Memory** is what lets step 3 refer to step 2: without it, every message starts from nothing, like Lab 1. **LASP tools (MCP)** leaves out the two plot tools (images would reach the model as base64 text). **Max Iterations** (12) is the safety belt.",
